- **test_escape_silent** (function_definition)
```Python
def test_escape_silent() -> None:
    assert escape_silent(None) == Markup()
    assert escape(None) == Markup(None)
    assert escape_silent("<foo>") == Markup("&lt;foo&gt;")
```
